#!/usr/bin/env python
"""Ps 139 corrected char-arc read. Omniscience psalm - the human interior as the
object of exhaustive divine knowledge, then zeal, then self-offering.
Lens = inner-being OPERATIONS: the interior laid open / the futile impulse to
flee / the inmost seat formed / the mind's limit / valuation / zeal-aversion /
the heart offered for search. God's knowing/forming acts = qualifier; the cosmic
merism + body-formation + God's-own-thoughts imagery = standalone."""
